            <ArticleTitle>Multidisciplinary care of the terminally ill patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>729-45, xi</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article discusses sedation, the assessment and management of physical symptoms, and symptom-assessment scales for the terminally ill patient. The evaluation of the ability of the family or community to care for a terminally ill patient in pain also is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
